WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:08.900
ComfyField · one idea, a finished scene

00:10.000 --> 00:14.600
Start with one idea

00:14.600 --> 00:20.400
Try the portal effect loads a free, built-in shot plan

00:20.400 --> 00:28.400
Every shot stays editable: prompt, camera move, duration, continuity

00:28.400 --> 00:34.700
Generate scene would render three LTX-2.5 clips, about $0.24. Not clicked here.

00:34.733 --> 00:41.833
The built-in plan, rendered earlier with LTX-2.5 on Comfy Cloud

00:42.033 --> 00:47.133
Add the three clips to a Stitch node

00:47.133 --> 00:54.133
Stitch scene joins them locally with ffmpeg

00:54.133 --> 00:59.633
Preview the finished 15-second scene

00:59.633 --> 01:05.933
Export to Assets, then download the MP4

01:06.133 --> 01:12.533
Every Cinema scene is a saved Flow

01:12.533 --> 01:16.633
Approve gates hold each shot until you press Send

01:16.833 --> 01:23.433
A scripted agent opens the same Flow through the local MCP server

01:23.433 --> 01:29.933
Its cursor and badge show the node it is editing

01:29.933 --> 01:36.833
The prompt is updated. Nothing runs until you press Run.

01:37.033 --> 01:44.033
Open source and local-first, on the Comfy Developer Platform

01:44.033 --> 01:46.933
Bring your own Comfy key. Clone it and make something.

01:49.300 --> 01:55.000
github.com/ergophobian/comfyfield · Bring your own Comfy key · MIT
